{"label":"batch02 209: formed email lists only that company services","ok":false,"detail":{"status":200,"notice":{"to":"batch02-437aeb64-e284-4d9d-bcd1-4b2507c5574c@example.test","subject":"Scope Beta, LLC is formed","html":"\n<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1c2530;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px\">\n  <p style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:18px;margin:0 0 16px\">MyFloridaSeriesLLC</p>\n  \n      <p>Dear Alice Example,</p>\n      <p>Congratulations, your Florida Protected Series LLC,\n      <strong>Scope Beta, LLC</strong>, has been officially formed\n      with the Florida Division of Corporations!</p>\n      <p>Two things are waiting in your portal, ready to download:</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Your <strong>Articles of Organization</strong>, as filed</li>\n        <li>Your <strong>Protected Series Designation</strong>,\n            as filed, covering:\n          <ul><li>Scope Beta, LLC, PS B</li></ul>\n        </li>\n        \n      </ul>\n      <p>Keep these with your company records — a bank, a title company, or a\n      closing agent will ask for them.</p>\n      <p>The next step is to create your operating agreement. You can do that\n      in your personal portal (<a href=\"http://localhost:8000/portal\">Click here to open</a>). Your Federal EIN order is in your portal as well — that's our next step.</p>\n      \n      <p>Thank you for doing business with MyFloridaSeriesLLC!</p>\n      <p>support@myfloridaseriesllc.com</p>\n    \n  <p style=\"color:#8a8f98;font-size:12px;margin-top:28px\">MyFloridaSeriesLLC — support@myfloridaseriesllc.com</p>\n</div>"}}}
